# Line endings — keep everything LF; scripts must stay executable-clean.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf

# --- Model weights -----------------------------------------------------------
# Deployed checkpoints are small (~260 KB each, ~3 MB total after the
# backup_* history dirs are pruned) and change rarely, so they are kept as
# plain git blobs. If retraining starts producing large artifacts, install
# git-lfs (sudo apt install git-lfs && git lfs install) and uncomment:
#
# *.pth  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.pt   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
#
# Until then, treat them as binary so git never tries to line-merge them:
*.pth  -text -diff
*.pt   -text -diff
*.ckpt -text -diff
